{"id":"n29025-2-8","stage":2,"title":"상당하다 · 相当好","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29025-2-8-1","ko":"승규가 영어 실력이 상당한데?","zh":"承奎的英语水平相当高啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"영어","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실력이","meaning":"实力，能力","explanation":"실력：实力，能力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"실력","audio":"/audio/e709c7a9c091424d582a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66283","senseId":"1","lemma":"실력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상당한데?","meaning":"相当好，相当强","explanation":"상당하다：相当好，相当强；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"상당하다","audio":"/audio/b01097a83d9cd3680a9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29025","senseId":"2","lemma":"상당하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9a37f8fdb58ccaa0","term":"영어","zh":"英语","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3","entryId":"28241","definition":"英国和美国等国家使用的世界上使用范围最广的语言。","pronunciation":["영어"]},{"id":"e709c7a9c091424d","term":"실력","zh":"实力，能力","audio":"/audio/e709c7a9c091424d582a.mp3","entryId":"66283","definition":"可以完成某事的能力。","pronunciation":["실력"]},{"id":"b01097a83d9cd368","term":"상당하다","zh":"相当好，相当强","audio":"/audio/b01097a83d9cd3680a9d.mp3","entryId":"29025","definition":"水平或实力、 程度非常高。","pronunciation":["상당하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/482f017175935382b514.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29025-2-8-2","ko":"어렸을 때부터 미국에서 살다가 왔대.","zh":"据说他从小就在美国生活，后来才回来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때부터","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미국에서","meaning":"美国","explanation":"미국：美国；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"미국에서","audio":"/audio/e15edc4d4f4a7863f8f2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"살다가","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔대.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/818395c2ddbdede37cfc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.453,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29025","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["承奎的英语水平相当高啊？","据